@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Independent Instagram receipt recovery
+
+**Goal:** Let the already authorized independent Instagram channel preserve the same verified-send, permanent-deduplication and checkpoint rules as the existing LinkedIn channel.
+
+**Context:** The current provider explicitly limits new LinkedIn Page conversations. Independent research remains active. An existing Instagram account and an official business conversation are observable through the authorized in-app browser. Opening a conversation or restoring login is not a send. The current receipt implementation supports email and LinkedIn only, so it cannot safely record an Instagram send as a qualifying receipt.
+
+**Architecture:** Extend only the pure typed social-receipt validator and existing receipt-patch helpers. Keep the established email and LinkedIn key bytes unchanged. Give Instagram its own evidence namespace and canonical provider profile/thread grammar. A real outgoing still requires independently reopened exact sender, recipient, body hash, timestamp and native image evidence; no fabricated email ID or thread URL is permitted. Match the actual screenshot format, extension and SHA without transcoding. Existing LinkedIn evidence keeps its established legacy format compatibility.
+
+1. Add synthetic validator regressions for valid Instagram proof, wrong provider/profile/thread, incomplete verification and unchanged older receipt keys.
+2. Extend the existing same-ID observation merge and typed task generation only for the supported verified social channels. Keep cross-channel company/group and exclusion locks.
+3. Run the targeted validator/checkpoint/patch-generator regressions and independent review. No real message is allowed before the safe receipt path is validated.
+4. Recheck actual company, territorial, account and contact-history gates; perform at most one genuine authorized message, independently reopen it, immediately append both permanent ledgers and reconcile campaign/daily counts.
+5. Publish the exact owner-private source and verify the anonymous-only public GitHub update. Retain the provider limit and all other channel gates; do not claim a daemon or permanent authentication.
+
+No Facebook history/PIN bypass, platform-account switch, paid message, new account registration, permission expansion, guessed contact or test email is part of this repair.
